File-pfopen Version 0.04

File::pfopen looks in a list of directories for a file, optionally trying
a list of suffixes, and opens the first one that it finds.

INSTALLATION

To install this module, run the following commands:

	perl Makefile.PL
	make
	make test
	make install

SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the
perldoc command.

	perldoc File::pfopen

You can also look for information at:

	MetaCPAN
		https://metacpan.org/release/File-pfopen

	RT, CPAN's request tracker
		https://rt.cpan.org/NoAuth/Bugs.html?Dist=File-pfopen

	GitHub
		https://github.com/nigelhorne/File-pfopen

